text.en:
Composition. - The Center shall be composed of
elements from the following:
Presidential Security Group;
Intelligence Service, Armed Forces of the Philippines;
Bureau of Customs (BOC);
Philippine National Police;
Philippine Coast Guard; and
Department of Justice (DOJ).
If necessary, the Center shall be augmented by other elements of
the Philippine Army, Philippine Air Force, Philippine Navy and the
National Intelligence Coordinating Agency.
